<title>USA: Collins &amp; Aikman issues $100 mln in 144a debt.</title>
<headline>Collins &amp; Aikman issues $100 mln in 144a debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt</p>
<p>issue from Collins &amp; Aikman Floorcoverings Inc was priced on</p>
<p>Wednesday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>BT Securities Corp was sole lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER COLLINS &amp; AIKMAN FLOORCOVERINGS INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.00 PCT  MATURITY 1/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SR SUB NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 7/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.00 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS			   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT PAR PLUS COUPON</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
